  "warnings": [
   "THE META SCHEDULE CONVERSION BROKE WITH THE GA4 EVENT. Schedules fell Aqua 19 to 6, Hutong 11 to 4, Cantina 7 to 1, Dim Sum Library 4 to 1, and The Chinese Library, Shiro (shared) and Vesu returned no conversions field at all, which is published as NULL and not as zero, following the treatment used for The Chinese Library Meta L33. The Canton Library, on the newer property and pixel, rose from 11 to 13. Meta bookings and Meta CPA for W37 are not performance figures.",
