   "Dim Sum Library Google has no walk-in conversion actions at all (only the booking action exists). Published as null, not zero. Vesu Google likewise has no walk-in actions.",
   "Vesu Meta bookings and CPA use the conversion (leads) campaign only. This week the account returned no Schedule rows at all, so Vesu Meta bookings and CPA are null. Conversion-campaign spend was HK$2,926.67 of HK$3,238.85 total; the awareness campaign carries no cost per booking.",
   "FLAGGED FOR REVIEW, THIRD WEEK: The Canton Library Google (5594089398) booking action Canton Library HK (web) sevenrooms_booking_complete recorded 12 conversions in W37 against 7.5 in W36, a book_now_button_click action recorded 101.8, and a Booking GTAG action recorded 10. Twelve conversions against 47 create-path GA4 bookings and HK$5,982 of spend is still not a verified working import, so Canton Google bookings and CPA stay published as not available, never zero, and the account Google spend is still kept out of ad-driven bookings, blended CPA and the paid funnel.",
